        "answer": {
          "short": "$110.8\\text{ m}^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\triangle OAB}&=\\frac12 ab\\sin C\\\\A_{\\triangle OAB}&=\\frac12(15)(15)\\sin100^\\circ\\\\A_{\\triangle OAB}&\\approx110.8\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
